# NOVA — .gitignore
#
# Secrets must never be committed. This file is a safety net, not the control:
# the rule in docs/development/DEVELOPMENT_RULES.md is the control.
#
# NOVA currently contains documentation only. Ecosystem-specific ignores are added
# when a technology is actually chosen (see docs/decisions/DEFERRED_DECISIONS.md),
# not speculatively.

# Secrets and local configuration
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials.json
secrets.json
*.secret
*.secrets

# OS and editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# Logs and temporary files
*.log
tmp/
.cache/
